PGDFS is derived from EtherDFS (http://etherdfs.sourceforge.net), the
Ethernet DOS file system by Mateusz Viste. The files PGUSDFS.C, GLOBALS.H,
DOSSTRUC.H, CHINT.H and CHINT086.ASM are modified copies of the EtherDFS
v0.8.2 client sources; the PicoGUS transport (XPORT.C, XPORT.H) and the
test tool (DFSDIAG.C) are new but distributed under the same terms.

CHINT086.ASM additionally contains code from the Open Watcom project,
Portions Copyright (c) 1983-2002 Sybase, Inc., distributed under the
Sybase Open Watcom Public License version 1.0 (see the file header).

